       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DYN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY DYNPGM.
       01  WS-NEXT PIC X(8).
       01  WS-MSG  PIC X(20) VALUE "CALL 'D9'".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 'D1' TO WS-NEXT WS-OTHER
           CALL WS-NEXT
           MOVE "D2" TO WS-NEXT.
           CALL WS-NEXT.
           CALL CP-PGM.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM(WS-OTHER) END-EXEC.
           CALL WS-NONE.
           DISPLAY WS-MSG.
